  "body": "Set on a freehold title and enjoying a fabulous central location with charming outlook this beautiful low maintenance home architecturally designed by Shanahan Architects is sensational. Constructed with dressed cedar and aluminium cladding the property features gorgeous formal and informal living and dining areas that open to a delightful sunny deck. \r\n\r\nThe attentional to detail in this high end luxury fit out is absolutely superb with ducted air-conditioning, electric cabin lift, high stud doors and ceilings. Featuring a gourmet designer kitchen with quality appliances. Four bedrooms, three stylish bathrooms and guest wc. \r\n\r\nDouble glazed joinery, fully fenced with a vehicle and security gate. Generous driveway width leading to a double garage, additional off street parking, outdoor areas and attractive landscaping. \r\n\r\nShort stroll to Takapuna Primary School, shops, restaurants, mall, cinema, theatre and pool. Westlake Girls and Takapuna Grammar School.\r\n\r\nDeadline Sale | Thursday 3rd December 2026 at 4pm (unless sold prior)",
